message: "If you use this material, please cite it as below."
title: "Interpretable ML — Lecture Materials"
authors:
  - family-names: "Bendinelli"
    given-names: "William"
type: software
year: 2026
url: "https://github.com/wbendinelli/interpretable-ml-lectures"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Lecture materials on machine learning interpretability for a graduate
  course at ICMC-USP, following Christoph Molnar's Interpretable Machine
  Learning. Module 01 is a fully reproducible, real-data walkthrough of
  LIME on the Breast Cancer Wisconsin (Diagnostic) dataset, including a
  line-by-line validation of the lime package internals.
